   00001| //! Grounded, verified workspace transformations learned from coding-task runs.
   00002| //!
   00003| //! The planner never edits request prose. It compiles a bounded transformation,
   00004| //! reads the client-owned bytes, executes the transformation in memory, applies
   00005| //! a compact edit or bounded replace-all operation, and accepts success only
   00006| //! after an exact content-digest observation. The same state machine composes
   00007| //! source creation with a second module-registration edit, so a multi-file
   00008| //! request cannot stop after its first observable effect.
